    <briefdescription>
<para>Base class for metadata table scan tasks. </para>
    </briefdescription>
    <detaileddescription>
<para>Metadata tables expose table metadata (snapshots, history, etc.) as queryable Arrow tables. A task is a unit of work opened by <ref refid="classiceberg_1_1MetadataScanTaskReader" kindref="compound">MetadataScanTaskReader</ref>. </para>
    </detaileddescription>
